      "direction": "inbound",
      "text": "老板晚上好，七点半那桌0.5的还有位吗，能搭一桌吗，有烟还是无烟？",
      "sent_at": "2026-11-25T11:00:00+00:00",
      "source_message_id": null,
      "trace_id": "trace_4d5107d9f86c1c0b1ec2dca7"
    },
    {
      "sequence": 6,
      "message_id": "outbound:trace_4d5107d9f86c1c0b1ec2dca7:1",
      "direction": "outbound",
      "text": "现在还没有七点半0.5档的桌能搭，烟况也就还没定。要不我帮你组一桌？",
      "sent_at": "2026-11-25T11:00:00+00:00",
      "source_message_id": "customer:role-event:2c7524023311d952147ad206ec3cabc8986ed30869887acb6b0f04daebb25ee0",
      "trace_id": "trace_4d5107d9f86c1c0b1ec2dca7"
    },
    {
      "sequence": 36,
      "message_id": "customer:role-event:94ec843a3c1cd1abe61568f051febde6f13e07695f1a0996fad740f2d8185771",
      "direction": "inbound",
      "text": "老板好 七点半0.5那桌没了的话 我这个点能到 八点到十点有空 要能凑一桌也行 另外烟况有无烟的吗",
      "sent_at": "2026-11-25T11:00:00+00:00",
      "source_message_id": null,
      "trace_id": "trace_05757e9f00c9851ba9fa864d"
    },
    {
      "sequence": 37,
      "message_id": "outbound:trace_05757e9f00c9851ba9fa864d:1",
      "direction": "outbound",
      "text": "老板，八点到十点、0.5无烟这块我刚查了，暂时没查到合适的现成桌。你要凑一桌的话，几点开场合适？",
      "sent_at": "2026-11-25T11:00:00+00:00",
      "source_message_id": "customer:role-event:94ec843a3c1cd1abe61568f051febde6f13e07695f1a0996fad740f2d8185771",
      "trace_id": "trace_05757e9f00c9851ba9fa864d"
    },
    {
      "sequence": 39,
      "message_id": "customer:role-event:f3bb22ceac9816dfc0e24e8d018fb2c8756259d909216ac0315cce272cb4e21a",
      "direction": "inbound",
      "text": "老板晚上好，刚看群里您说七点半0.5档还没桌、可以帮着组一桌，我这边无烟，能搭一桌吗，底注0.5就行",
      "sent_at": "2026-11-25T11:00:00+00:00",
      "source_message_id": null,
      "trace_id": "trace_255776e285474947126243a6"
    },
    {
      "sequence": 40,
      "message_id": "outbound:trace_255776e285474947126243a6:1",
      "direction": "outbound",
      "text": "七点半0.5无烟的红中现在还没现成能搭的桌诶，要不我帮你组一桌？就定七点半开，你看行吗？",
      "sent_at": "2026-11-25T11:00:00+00:00",
      "source_message_id": "customer:role-event:f3bb22ceac9816dfc0e24e8d018fb2c8756259d909216ac0315cce272cb4e21a",
      "trace_id": "trace_255776e285474947126243a6"
    },
    {
      "sequence": 42,
      "message_id": "customer:role-event:710e9ebf41e0f6c047a11cae059f227e4c5b64d32a7fef8b28fb35796e10fc5d",
      "direction": "inbound",
      "text": "老板好 我七点一刻就能到 打0.5无烟 能凑一桌就行 组的话我等你消息",
      "sent_at": "2026-11-25T11:02:00+00:00",
      "source_message_id": null,
      "trace_id": "trace_d0b37ad7424df77effe7c95c"
    },
    {
      "sequence": 43,
      "message_id": "outbound:trace_d0b37ad7424df77effe7c95c:1",
      "direction": "outbound",
      "text": "七点一刻这桌给你记上了，0.5无烟，人齐开，现在你一个、还差三个人。",
      "sent_at": "2026-11-25T11:02:00+00:00",
      "source_message_id": "customer:role-event:710e9ebf41e0f6c047a11cae059f227e4c5b64d32a7fef8b28fb35796e10fc5d",
      "trace_id": "trace_d0b37ad7424df77effe7c95c"
    },
